                                                "example_id": "aa523e61-f217-4652-ab58-e96853d03d37",
                                                "sense_id": "fe2e108b-ca13-3da9-a8a3-e70f972d40bf",
                                                "text": "If you intend to make half a dozen cups of coffee for drinking, measure six cups of water of the same size, and put the water into the coffee-pot."
